WEBVTT

00:03:58.108 --> 00:04:01.042
And she did what she thought
was right for her country.

00:04:02.265 --> 00:04:04.733
I know how strong that message was.

00:04:05.273 --> 00:04:08.281
It was everywhere
around myself when I grew up.

00:04:08.305 --> 00:04:11.029
It was printed on matches,

00:04:11.053 --> 00:04:12.689
playing cards,

00:04:12.713 --> 00:04:14.775
textbooks, posters.

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:17.243
The propaganda praising
the one-child policy

00:04:17.267 --> 00:04:18.949
was everywhere around us.

00:04:18.973 --> 00:04:21.521
[Anyone who refuses to sterilize
will be arrested.]

00:04:21.545 --> 00:04:23.879
And so were the threats
against disobeying it.

00:04:23.903 --> 00:04:26.339
The message seeped into our minds

00:04:26.363 --> 00:04:29.568
so much so that I grew up
feeling embarrassed

00:04:29.592 --> 00:04:31.380
for having a younger brother.